title: Building a citizens society.
new-page: true
is-card: true
card-image: img/kcp_peoplesparty.png
view-if: peoples_party_support >= 3 and peoples_party = 0 and peoples_party_timer == 0
on-arrival: peoples_party_timer = 6
tags: party_affairs
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Can the KCP become the shining beacon of a wide citizen participation in our democracy?

= Building a People's Party

The original constitutionalist vision for the growing republic was the ever increasing participation of everyday citizens in the democracy and while the status quo has slowly formed a tight knit democracy which some may even call a oligarchy we have the power to stop this fossilization and finaly make the step forward to a true citizens democracy.

- @support_peoples_party: Yes , the citizens party is here!
- @build_support: We must build additional support and infrastructure to accomodate such a broadening of the party.
- @no_new_ideas: No, we will always be a guiding force of the people rather than a educator of the masses
- @root: Perhaps we can discuss this at a later time.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@build_support
view-if: (humanist_strength + liberal_strength + socialist_strength < constitutionalist_strength + neoforsvollrist_strength) or peoples_party_support < 5
on-arrival: peoples_party_support += 1; humanist_strength += 5; neoforsvollrist_strength -= 5; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 5

We are pushing the idea of devolving the party into wings of internal democracy and building the necessary infrastructure.


@support_peoples_party
choose-if: (humanist_strength + liberal_strength + socialist_strength >= constitutionalist_strength + neoforsvollrist_strength) and peoples_party_support >= 4
unavailable-subtitle: The opposition is too strong.
on-arrival: humanist_strength += 15; liberal_strength += 15; socialist_strength += 10; liberal_dissent -= 10; humanist_dissent -= 10; peoples_party = 1; workers_kcp += 12; rural_kcp += 10; new_middle_kcp += 10; old_middle_kcp += 8; catholics_kcp += 8; neoforsvollrist_dissent += 25; constitutionalist_dissent += 20; up_relation += 10; kcp_democracy += 1;

In a emergency party conference it is declared that we are now a party for all people of Kaddu to act as their democracy with debate and inter wing competition being expressly encouraged. Our opponents critizice this as a attempt of the KCP to become the senate some however nod along with agreement. 

And so within our party begins the experiment for devolution of the legislature.

- @campaign_workers
- @campaign_middle
- @campaign_rural
- @campaign_unemployed
- @campaign_women

@campaign_workers
title: Campaign among the workers, to assuage their doubts about our changes.
on-arrival: workers_kcp += 6*(1-dissent);

The workers will surely welcome our new citizens society outlook.

@campaign_middle
title: Campaign among the middle classes.
on-arrival: old_middle_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 6*(1-dissent)

We are reaching the middle classes thanks to our new image.

@campaign_rural
title: Campaign in rural areas.
choose-if: rural_policy > 0
unavailable-subtitle: We have not enacted any rural policies yet.
on-arrival: rural_kcp += 14*(1-dissent)

We are beggining to include local cooperatives and farmers leagues into our party structures. This builds support monumentaly.

@campaign_unemployed
title: Campaign among the unemployed.
on-arrival: unemployed_kcp += 6*(1-dissent);

We begin integrating aid programmes and providing free housing to the poor. This bolsters our support among the impoverished.

@campaign_women
title: Campaign among women of all classes.
on-arrival: workers_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); rural_kcp += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed_kcp += 3*(1-dissent);

With a open space to filter political views openly and safely we provide a haven for those who would often be discouraged by the harshness of regular politics.

@campaign_catholics
title: Campaign among political regionalists.
on-arrival: catholics_kcp += 7*(1-dissent);

We are increasing our voting share even among the regionalist voters as we now can provide them a geniune and more moderate platform where to air their issues on local cultures and such.

@no_new_ideas
on-arrival: liberal_strength -= 6; liberal_dissent += 5; constitutionalist_strength += 8; neoforsvollrist_strength += 15; peoples_party = 0; peoples_party_support -= 3

The KCP must stay the guiding hand of the public and not become some play pen for whatever radicals come around. We know whats best for the people.
